1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,500
Habitat Health Monitor.

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:04,200
A camera tracks each lift on the bench,

3
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:07,600
and turns every rep into work, in joules.

4
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:11,200
Sensors reach the hub over USB and Wi-Fi.

5
00:00:11,300 --> 00:00:14,500
One hub judges every reading, offline.

6
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:18,300
The panel shows food energy, training work and mass.

7
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:21,500
Cabin readings are judged against NASA's own limits.

8
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:25,400
Earth sees it later, over a simulated Mars link.

9
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:29,000
An educational prototype, not a medical device.
